    {"type":"text","id":"legendtext","x":60,"y":1530,"width":1160,"height":125,"text":"Agents: Reese Retirement · Ethan Excel · Ravi Runbook · Morgan Motion · Bianca Briefing · Felix Followup · Moxie MSX · Maurice Mailing · Quinn Quality\nHuman checkpoints: Steps 1, 3, 5, 8, 14, 15, 18\nMoxie: Step 12 = read-only proposal; Step 15 = hash-bound approval; Step 16 = approved MSX write + readback\nMaurice: Step 17 = read-only mail proposal; Step 18 = hash-bound send approval; Step 19 = approved send + receipt\nLoop-backs: Quinn routes artifact defects; REVISE MSX returns to Step 12; REVISE MAIL returns to Step 17.","fontSize":15,"fontFamily":2,"strokeColor":"#000000","textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top"},

